<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quorum Health lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quorum Health lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it lowered its intermediate-term recommendation on Quorum Health Group Inc to neutral from accumulate but left unchanged the long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3-3/8 to 35-1/4 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
